# @option -ofmt[?`_static_run_ofmt`]            Override target object format
# @option -mcpu[?`_choice_zig_cpu`] <cpu>       Specify target CPU and feature set
# @option -mcmodel[default|extreme|kernel|large|medany|medium|medlow|medmid|normal|small|tiny]  Limit range of code and data virtual addresses
